</p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">The class has </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">2 static methods</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">:\n1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">convert(length) </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">where </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">length </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">is a string consisting of a value and unit (eg. 3.5cm, 21.9inch, etc). If the unit in </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">length </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">is cm, it will display the value in inch. If the unit in </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">length </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">is inch, it will display the value in cm. Round the answer up to 1 decimal place.\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">main()</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">which repeatedly asks the user to input a length with its unit (no spacing in between) and call </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">convert() </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">to perform the conversion until user enters \"end\".\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Create a program to run </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre-wrap; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">main()</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> without instancing an object.\n</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Follow the test output display format and comment your codes.\n</span></p><div><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Test Input</span></u><br></div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">1inch\n2.54cm\n13.2cm\n9.4inch\nend</span></p><p><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\